  unitName: Penta Blade Zergel
  unitId: 60644
  unitNumber: 831
  description: A sword blacksmith from the Agni Empire. It is said that once the
    war with the gods began, he lost his family to the God Army. His mentality completely
    changed after this, leading him to research divine weapons in order to create
    ones capable of slaying the gods. Being a swordsman as well, he tested his countless
    blades by fighting in the frontlines of the battlefield. It is said that those
    who witnessed this battle-hungry demon fight believed he was neither Zergel the
    blacksmith, nor Zergel the swordsman.
  summonDesc: I will slay all the gods.<br>That is my only wish!
  fusionDesc: I can never erase<br>that image from my mind...<br>Curse you, gods!
  evoDesc: This technique...<br>All right, I'll light the furnace.<br>It's time to
    make a better sword.
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
